        "paragraph": "<p>To examine the impact of a new teaching method on student performance in mathematics, researchers conducted a study with two groups of students over a semester. One group received instruction using the traditional teaching method, while the other group used the new interactive teaching method. The researchers measured the students’ scores on a standardized mathematics test at the beginning of the semester, at the mid-point, and at the end of the semester. The hypothesis was that the interactive teaching method would lead to significantly higher test scores compared to the traditional method.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"image\">\n<svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"568.11pt\" height=\"425.306394pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 568.11 425.306394\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" version=\"1.1\">\n <metadata>\n  <rdf:RDF xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:cc=\"http://creativecommons.org/ns#\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\">\n   <cc:Work>\n    <dc:type rdf:resource=\"http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/StillImage\"/>\n    <dc:date>2026-03-05T00:10:56.093355</dc:date>\n    <dc:format>image/svg+xml</dc:format>\n    <dc:creator>\n     <cc:Agent>\n      <dc:title>Matplotlib v3.10.8, https://matplotlib.org/</dc:title>\n     </cc:Agent>\n    </dc:creator>\n   </cc:Work>\n  </rdf:RDF>\n </metadata>\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">*{stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: butt}</style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 425.306394 \nL 568.11 425.306394 \nL 568.11 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill: #ffffff\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 50.81 335.511363 \nL 560.91 335.511363 \nL 560.91 23.077969 \nL 50.81 23.077969 \nz\n\" style=\"fill: #ffffff\"/>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"patch_3\">\n    <path d=\"M 73.996364 335.511363 \nL 112.640303 335.511363 \nL 112.640303 179.294666 \nL 73.996364 179.294666 \nz\n\" clip-path=\"url(#pb830d51091)\"